WEBVTT

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:04.540
It's still on my tail? What a persistent Wild Zoid.

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:16.130
It's gone...

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:22.500
You gave up already?

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:27.930
Damn!

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:40.280
The Boy From Planet Zi

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:53.840
Why? Why is this Wild Zoid firing at me?

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:57.020
Keep running, keep running!

00:02:57.980 --> 00:03:01.420
You are just a test subject to check my Zoid's performance.

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:07.810
I'll show you that even a guy like me can properly control a Zoid.

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:10.170
That's not a Wild Zoid!

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:13.840
It's attacking, so there must be somebody piloting it.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:17.980
Geez... I just can't shake it off. What's with this useless hoverboard?

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:19.360
What should I do...?

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:29.200
A ruin?

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:30.900
Maybe I can hide here...

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:53.530
Running is useless... I'll continue to chase you no matter where you go.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:22.800
He's crazy...

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:30.920
That Bull guy sure got fired up.

00:04:31.490 --> 00:04:32.840
Yeah, you could say that.

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:38.400
We got these Command Wolves from the boss, but he got nothing.

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:42.450
Giving a Zoid to a rookie would be a waste of resources.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.500
I guess it makes sense.

00:04:45.020 --> 00:04:50.720
He's fired up after getting that Guysack, even if it's just an old Wild Zoid.

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:56.930
But chasing that kid around isn't something to boast about.

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:01.570
I agree.

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:09.060
But then again, if that brat is from a nearby village, it would be bad if he told them about us.

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:15.180
What the hell is he chasing me around for? What have I done?

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:24.460
Nothing— No... Actually, there is something.

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:30.610
You just happened to come by right after I managed to capture this Guysack.

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:33.930
In other words, it's just your bad day.

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:37.760
And I hate losers like you!

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:45.170
Damn it. What a reason...

00:05:57.340 --> 00:05:58.760
W-Wh-What?

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:03.650
Damn it.

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:13.250
T-That kid... Like I'm gonna let you go!

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:17.420
Alright!

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:41.420
Hey... Bull!

00:06:42.930 --> 00:06:43.860
Respond!

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:45.280
Hey! Bull!

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:46.860
What a clumsy fellow.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:49.410
It can't be helped... let's go rescue him.

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:51.700
That guy always gives me problems. Really!

00:06:57.120 --> 00:06:59.090
Wow, the whole thing collapsed.

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:05.850
My board is a wreck too...

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:09.320
I can't possibly get back to the village without this.

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:12.290
I don't even have the parts to fix it either.

00:07:13.940 --> 00:07:19.290
That's it! There might be some spare parts from machines used in the previous war.

00:07:20.260 --> 00:07:20.940
Alright!

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:26.300
Like I'm going to find anything.

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:29.660
I've already been here so many times...

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:33.760
All the useful stuff has already been taken.

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:37.800
Bull here. Please respond!

00:07:38.940 --> 00:07:40.840
Bianco here. Are you alright?

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:42.760
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:07:43.240 --> 00:07:47.770
Damn it. I've sure messed things up. Just a little bit more 'til I break free.

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:50.890
Damn it. Move it, you stupid thing.

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:53.530
Where's that kid?

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:55.820
He's in the ruins you blew up.

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.850
Damn it, that brat!

00:07:58.400 --> 00:08:01.880
You fool, it's all your fault for messing things up.

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:04.490
Stirring things up with that damned Guysack.

00:08:05.450 --> 00:08:09.340
Come on, We'll show you the real way to handle a Zoid.

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:10.640
Watch closely!

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:12.380
Sorry...

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:19.920
Damn, there's nothing here.

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:23.280
W-What?

00:08:39.610 --> 00:08:43.480
That's it. There is no way he could've survived that.

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:45.720
Look who just got all stirred up by a brat.

00:08:46.440 --> 00:08:47.960
That makes you the same as Bull.

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:50.970
I'm going to go retrieve his Guysack, give me a hand.

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:52.150
Fine.

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:03.100
That was close. Bad luck just keeps on coming.

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:12.080
That's...

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:16.100
Looks like that's the only way to go.

00:09:22.820 --> 00:09:25.250
Was there a hidden room here?

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:26.840
Could it be a hangar?

00:09:29.770 --> 00:09:33.120
That's... the power's still on. I wonder why...

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:41.210
Wow! The systems here are still working.

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:42.870
What's that?

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:02.930
Van!

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:04.180
Van! Van!

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:06.690
Where are you? Van!

00:10:08.010 --> 00:10:13.770
That guy... he didn't even help out in the house. I wonder where he went?

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:15.580
Yo! Miss Maria.

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:18.980
Your brother's gone missing again?

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:20.820
Yes, Father.

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:26.660
Van's not here though. Didn't he go exploring in the desert again?

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:28.860
Yeah... he sure did.

00:10:29.260 --> 00:10:32.400
He always goes there, but I constantly tell him how dangerous it is.

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:36.100
Well, let's overlook this matter.

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:40.680
It's impossible for him to suppress his eagerness to own a Zoid.

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:41.620
Look at this.

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:43.210
This is...

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:44.580
Probably...

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:48.680
The boy remembered today was the anniversary of our father's death.

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:56.240
It's been five years since your father lost his life fighting to protect the village with Sieg.

00:10:56.940 --> 00:11:01.000
You should know best what Van has always said since then.

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:09.640
"Someday I will find a partner Zoid like Sieg, and become an excellent Zoid pilot like our father.”

00:11:12.180 --> 00:11:13.540
But, Father.

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:17.840
Even if he gets lucky and finds a Wild Zoid,

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:20.730
will it even listen to him?

00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:26.090
Well, it depends on how well he can communicate with it.

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:31.260
And besides, it's rare to see a Wild Zoid nowadays...

00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:35.090
There are mostly only strays which have escaped from the army.

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:51.720
No matter how I look at it, it looks like a Zoid.

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:58.080
That means if I open it, this could be the partner Zoid that I've always dreamed of!

00:12:52.780 --> 00:12:55.200
You've gotta be kidding me. A Zoid has been born?

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:59.140
I've never heard before that Zoids are born like this.

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:01.690
A-Awesome.

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:07.900
I've never seen anything like this before, it's just beautiful.

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:11.660
I can't believe that there are still Wild Zoids on this planet.

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:43.640
Don't be afraid, I just want to be your partner.

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:47.040
l am Van, and you are?

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:05.450
Ouch...

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:14.570
Way to go, you have to be this strong to be my partner.

00:14:16.610 --> 00:14:20.540
I've decided. No matter what the others say, I am taking you home.

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:21.400
Come...

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:26.680
How about I call you Sieg?

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:29.010
It was the name of my late father's Zoid.

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:30.780
Pretty cool, isn't it?

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:48.440
I will sniff you out wherever you hide.

00:14:48.540 --> 00:14:49.730
You won't escape.

00:14:51.650 --> 00:14:54.540
What's that? A Wild Zoid?

00:14:57.200 --> 00:15:00.380
I've found some good stuff... I can get rich from this.

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:02.120
Hey brat...

00:15:02.280 --> 00:15:04.850
A rookie like you doesn't deserve this.

00:15:05.760 --> 00:15:07.360
Hand it over!

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:14.600
Now, you had better hand it over!

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:30.170
I'll hold him back. Sieg, get out of here now!

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:35.420
I said get out of here! Don't you understand?

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:41.840
P-Please, just for once, listen to me!

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:45.560
I don't know what he'll do to you if he captures you.

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:47.890
You... damned brat...!

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:55.760
Damn it...

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:07.420
Now you've done it... making me look like a fool twice.

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:10.610
I'll crush you!!

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:24.860
You... you're trying, to,help me?

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:28.660
You bastard.

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:36.050
You'll sure have to learn the hard way, little guy!

00:16:50.850 --> 00:16:51.660
Stop...

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:59.860
It's enough...

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:02.810
Please stop!!

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:12.810
You''re wasting my precious time. You should know what'll happen if you defy me!

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:16.180
Sieg, you idiot.

00:17:16.340 --> 00:17:20.420
You can't possibly defeat such a large Zoid with your size.

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:26.210
l am sorry. I just woke you up.

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:28.290
So...

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:29.500
So... So...

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:30.770
Don't die on me.

00:17:30.890 --> 00:17:33.360
Damn it. What should I do?

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:40.500
Sie... Sieg!

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:45.490
This guy still doesn't get it.

00:17:46.010 --> 00:17:48.160
Cut it out, Sieg! You're no match for him.

00:17:48.440 --> 00:17:50.520
You'll really die this time. Stop!

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:54.610
Cut it out, Sieg!

00:17:54.930 --> 00:17:56.880
Just forget what I said about being my partner.

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:00.040
I don't want to see things like...

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:04.780
...what happened to my dad again!

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:09.150
Sieg....

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:10.620
What?

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:13.120
What're you up to, Sieg? Stop.

00:18:26.730 --> 00:18:28.490
What the hell is this?

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:32.890
What's that?

00:18:32.940 --> 00:18:33.970
A new type of Zoid?

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:37.900
Where are you going?

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:42.920
Shield Liger?

00:18:43.210 --> 00:18:44.880
What should we do about Bull's Guysack?

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:47.170
Like I know... that Zoid comes first.

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:51.840
What are you bringing me here for?

00:18:57.210 --> 00:19:00.250
You want me to pilot this?

00:19:05.970 --> 00:19:07.720
They're with the Guysack.

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:11.380
Damn it. They're still at it.

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:14.240
Sieg!

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:21.650
What?

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:25.520
What's happening?

00:19:32.890 --> 00:19:34.660
Wha... what's that?

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:36.820
Shield... Liger...

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:46.280
I see... so this is your ability.

00:19:51.840 --> 00:19:53.810
Nero! Don't chicken out.

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:56.540
The Shield Liger is a top class Zoid.

00:19:56.640 --> 00:19:58.570
There is no way that kid can control it.

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:01.120
Let's go! Sieg!

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:04.840
You brat!

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:18.850
Impossible.

00:20:19.370 --> 00:20:21.420
How can that kid handle it like that?

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:25.920
My Combat System has frozen up.

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:26.640
Same here.

00:20:27.210 --> 00:20:29.180
Nothing we can do about it... let's retreat!

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:53.370
Yeah! We've done it, Sieg!

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:56.450
It's my first time piloting a Zoid, and I won!

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:02.010
My pleasure to meet you, Sieg.

00:21:09.220 --> 00:21:10.330
What's up, Sieg?

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:14.300
Hey, Sieg, where are you going?

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:20.220
This is... well,

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:24.320
it was beside you, so maybe it's your brother?

00:21:26.290 --> 00:21:28.080
Oh! It's working! It's working!

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:29.450
This one works too.

00:21:29.650 --> 00:21:31.480
Look! Sieg. It's about to be born.

00:21:33.530 --> 00:21:36.490
It was beside you, it must be your brother.

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:39.610
It must be a great Zoid too.

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:46.890
I did it! It's been born.

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:52.130
Come, Sieg.

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:56.640
Though it's small, come and see your cute bro...

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:07.720
Or... your sister...?

00:23:25.610 --> 00:23:26.890
Yo! I'm Van.

00:23:26.970 --> 00:23:32.490
I don't quite understand it, but I've started my journey with Sieg and the girl that was born alongside him.

00:23:32.540 --> 00:23:38.140
Even though she's cute, she can't remember anything, including her own name.

00:23:38.380 --> 00:23:42.900
Well, anyway, I took her back to the village with me.

00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:45.450
But what's waiting there is...

00:23:45.960 --> 00:23:47.820
Next time, Zoids episode 02!

00:23:47.850 --> 00:23:49.460
Mysterious beauty Fiine!

00:23:49.600 --> 00:23:52.420
I'm excited to see you again next time!
